.TH "nvme_init_identify_underlying_ns_list" 9 "nvme_init_identify_underlying_ns_list" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_identify_underlying_ns_list \- Initialize passthru command for Get Underlying Namespace List
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_identify_underlying_ns_list
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 idx "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_underlying_ns_list *list "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Command data structure to initialize
.IP "idx" 12
Index into the list of reportable Underlying Namespaces to
start reporting from
.IP "list" 12
User space destination address to transfer the data
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Identify command with
CNS value NVME_IDENTIFY_CNS_UNDERLYING_NS_LIST.
